Releases of Samara are on hold (2026-11-25).

The installed Samaras (1.63.0, built before this repo) keep his data under the companion's old names: their own
folders on the Mac and the PC, the Mac's Keychain item that unlocks his logins, and the PC install spot the launcher
reads. This repo's code looked under "Samara" instead, so its first update would have started him empty: logins,
cookies, Bitwarden, notes, castLabs.

The release workflow (samara-release.yml) and ship.mjs refuse to run while this file exists. It is deleted by the
change that makes the new code use his existing folders (src/dirs.ts).
